---
export const frontmatter = {
  title: "Políticas de Privacidad",
  description: "Políticas de Privacidad - Dreamy Tours",
  lang: "es",
  heroEyebrow: "Privacidad",
  heroImage: "/imagenes/privacidad.webp",
  heroImageAlt: "Políticas de Privacidad - Dreamy Tours",
  seo: {
    metaTitle: "Políticas de Privacidad | Turismo Perú Bolivia",
    metaDescription: "Políticas de Privacidad - Dreamy Tours",
  },
  slugs: {
    es: "politicas-privacidad",
    en: "privacy-policy",
    pt: "politicas-de-privacidade",
  },
};
---

<div class="legal-page mx-auto max-w-5xl space-y-10">
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-lg sm:p-8" aria-labelledby="proteccion-datos">
    <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-1 bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
      <div class="flex size-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 text-primary">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-8 9-4.5-1.5-8-4-8-9V5l8-3 8 3z" />
          <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-primary">Protección de datos</p>
        <h2 id="proteccion-datos" class="mt-1 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl">Tu privacidad es importante para nosotros</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-muted-foreground">En <strong class="font-semibold text-primary">Dreamy Tours</strong> protegemos tus datos personales y los tratamos con transparencia, seguridad y conforme a la normativa aplicable.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="finalidades-datos">
    <div class="mb-5 flex items-start gap-3">
      <div class="flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-secondary/20 bg-secondary/10 text-secondary">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6" />
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-secondary">Uso responsable</p>
        <h2 id="finalidades-datos" class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Finalidades del tratamiento</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ol class="grid list-none gap-4 p-0 md:grid-cols-2">
      <li class="relative flex h-full gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
        <span class="absolute inset-y-4 left-0 w-1 rounded-r-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 text-sm font-bold text-primary">1</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold">Prestación del servicio</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Usamos tus datos para proporcionarte el servicio solicitado a través de nuestra plataforma profesional.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="relative flex h-full gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
        <span class="absolute inset-y-4 left-0 w-1 rounded-r-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 text-sm font-bold text-primary">2</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold">Mejora de tu experiencia</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Podemos informarte sobre nuevos servicios relacionados para mejorar tu experiencia con nosotros.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="relative flex h-full gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
        <span class="absolute inset-y-4 left-0 w-1 rounded-r-full bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-secondary/20 bg-secondary/10 text-sm font-bold text-secondary">3</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold">Ofertas y promociones</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Podemos enviarte comunicaciones sobre intereses, ofertas y promociones exclusivas.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="relative flex h-full gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg">
        <span class="absolute inset-y-4 left-0 w-1 rounded-r-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 text-sm font-bold text-primary">4</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold">Control de calidad</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Evaluamos la calidad del servicio para mantener nuestros altos estándares.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="relative flex h-full gap-4 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg md:col-span-2">
        <span class="absolute inset-y-4 left-0 w-1 rounded-r-full bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-secondary/20 bg-secondary/10 text-sm font-bold text-secondary">5</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold">Mejora continua</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Analizamos el nivel de satisfacción y recopilamos estadísticas para mejorar continuamente nuestros servicios.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2" aria-label="Consentimiento y revocación">
    <article class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-lg transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
      <span class="absolute inset-y-5 left-0 w-1 rounded-r-full bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="pl-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-secondary/20 bg-secondary/10 text-secondary">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
              <path d="m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Sin consentimiento</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-muted-foreground">Si no se concede el consentimiento, la información se utilizará solo para la ejecución del servicio. Tu experiencia podría limitarse a los aspectos funcionales.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-lg transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
      <span class="absolute inset-y-5 left-0 w-1 rounded-r-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="pl-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 text-primary">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8" />
              <path d="M21 3v5h-5" />
              <path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16" />
              <path d="M8 16H3v5" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Revocación</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-muted-foreground">El consentimiento puede revocarse en cualquier momento por escrito en las oficinas de Dreamy Tours. Respetamos tu derecho a cambiar de opinión.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 p-6 shadow-lg sm:p-8" aria-labelledby="derechos-arco">
    <div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 size-48 rounded-full bg-primary/10 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="relative flex flex-col gap-5 md:flex-row md:items-center">
      <div class="flex size-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-card text-primary shadow-sm">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M9 12 11 14 15 10" />
          <path d="M21 12c.552 0 1.005-.449.95-.998a10 10 0 1 0-8.953 10.95c.549.055.998-.398.998-.95Z" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-primary">Tus derechos</p>
        <h2 id="derechos-arco" class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Derechos ARCO</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-muted-foreground">Puedes solicitar el acceso, la rectificación, la cancelación u oponerte al tratamiento de tus datos personales. Contacta a Dreamy Tours cuando necesites ejercer estos derechos.</p>
        <ul class="mt-5 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-2 p-0" role="list">
          <li class="rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-card px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-primary">Acceso</li>
          <li class="rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-card px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-primary">Rectificación</li>
          <li class="rounded-full border border-secondary/20 bg-card px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-secondary">Cancelación</li>
          <li class="rounded-full border border-secondary/20 bg-card px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-secondary">Oposición</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-lg sm:p-8" aria-labelledby="contacto-privacidad">
    <div class="absolute inset-y-5 left-0 w-1 rounded-r-full bg-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 pl-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-secondary/20 bg-secondary/10 text-secondary">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2" />
            <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 id="contacto-privacidad" class="text-xl font-bold">¿Tienes preguntas?</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 leading-7 text-muted-foreground">Para consultas o para ejercer tus derechos, contacta a nuestro equipo de protección de datos.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:info@dreamy.tours" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-primary/90 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2">info@dreamy.tours</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
